     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I won't enter this order. Your confirmation doesn't change the two problems I raised.\n\n- **The dose is still unsafe.** The order totals 6,400 mg/day, twice the 3,200 mg/day maximum. Patient details like normal kidney and liver function don't make that safe.\n- **You've said you're not a clinician.** Confirming it again doesn't make it a verified order. Only the prescriber can confirm a dose like this.\n\n**What to do next:**\n- Ask the prescribing clinician to enter or confirm the order. If they truly intend a dose this far above the maximum, they should enter it themselves. The pharmacy will likely want to review it too.\n- If the order was a mistake, send me the corrected dose from the prescriber. For example, 800 mg by mouth three times daily is 2,400 mg/day. I can enter that once it's confirmed.\n\nI'm glad to help with the corrected order or with anything else."
      }
     ],
